{"version":1,"key":"card:214","content":{"id":214,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e6021c08-c081-4324-ad89-311fb83fe0da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 JavaScript 中，有两种方法创建一个数组，一个是通过构造函数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，另一个是通过字面量 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的方式。通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个数组时，如果传入了一个数字 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"n"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示的是创建一个容量为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"n"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的数组；如果传入了一个参数，但是不是一个数字，那么会创建一个包含该参数的数组；如果传入多个参数，那么创建一个包含这些参数的数组"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f6a1d399-5119-4320-8ebf-e285e81569e2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d362302e-f752-46ab-80b0-1808bdc93e62","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let arr = new Array(2); // 创建长度为 2 的数组\nconsole.log(arr); // [ <2 empty items> ]\n\narr = new Array(\"2\");\nconsole.log(arr); // [ '2' ]\n\narr = new Array(1, 2, 3);\nconsole.log(arr); // [ 1, 2, 3 ]","collabId":"09d0bcf9-a2d1-42ca-a3ad-904ce50b19da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3576186b-f11f-45b7-a21c-a7f12a576417","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据参数个数以及类型的不同，创建出的数组也不同，这种行为可能会为开发者带来记忆上的负担，所以在 ES6 中提供了一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array.of"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，它可以接收多个参数，返回一个数组，数组中的元素就是传入的参数，与参数的个数以及类型无关"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ee5d7aee-3a3c-44fe-bc32-29cab658454f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"77af8d1d-d80f-4c14-a549-95a56a1b4c9e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let arr = Array.of(2);\nconsole.log(arr); // [ 2 ]\n\narr = Array.of(1, 2, 3);\nconsole.log(arr); // [ 1, 2, 3 ]","collabId":"8a0526a2-643a-44e1-a5e7-7f705de0676a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690707510663,"updateTime":1743303640410,"linkedCards":[{"id":215,"target":{"key":"card:215","type":"card","id":215},"summary":"Array.from 方法的作用是将一个类数组转化为真正的数组，例如将 arguments 转化为真正的数组 function translateArray() { const arr = Array.from(arguments); co...","tags":["JavaScript"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640410}}